WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.532
Kip still wanted to be good at something.

2
00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:18.668
He got some of his acorns.

3
00:00:18.669 --> 00:00:22.515
"Watch this, Bird!" said Kip.

4
00:00:22.516 --> 00:00:26.304
He started to juggle the acorns.

5
00:00:26.305 --> 00:00:29.365
Plonk! Plip! Pling!

6
00:00:29.366 --> 00:00:32.977
One by one they fell down.

7
00:00:32.978 --> 00:00:35.277
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed.

8
00:00:35.278 --> 00:00:38.333
"You are so silly, Kip!"

9
00:00:38.334 --> 00:00:43.864
"I'm silly," said Kip.

10
00:00:43.865 --> 00:00:51.018
"But I'm not good at anything."

11
00:00:51.019 --> 00:00:54.170
Kip got his jump rope.

12
00:00:54.171 --> 00:00:58.865
"Watch this, Bird!" he said.

13
00:00:58.866 --> 00:01:04.636
Kip started to jump rope.

14
00:01:04.637 --> 00:01:09.273
But the rope got stuck on a branch.

15
00:01:09.274 --> 00:01:11.472
"Help!" said Kip.

16
00:01:11.473 --> 00:01:15.643
He swung around and around and around.

17
00:01:15.644 --> 00:01:18.425
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed again.

18
00:01:18.426 --> 00:01:21.658
"You are so silly, Kip!"

19
00:01:21.659 --> 00:01:24.266
"I'm silly," said Kip.

20
00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:27.719
"But I'm not good at anything!"

21
00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.937
Bird was quiet for a moment.

22
00:01:30.938 --> 00:01:34.212
"I just thought of something," she said.

23
00:01:34.213 --> 00:01:37.968
"Something you are very good at."

24
00:01:37.969 --> 00:01:41.010
"What am I good at?" asked Kip.

25
00:01:41.011 --> 00:01:47.772
"Making me laugh!" said Bird.

